comparison constant (lem:comparison, main.tex:985): for this curve the CM
curve underlying the Katz measure may be taken to be E itself, and the
period ratio is supported on {2,7} (main.tex remark at 1037-1046), so
v_p(c_p) = 0 at EVERY split p. Not a computation; quoted from the frozen paper.

